  "summaries": [
    {
      "id": 467146,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "The CVE-2024-27980 was identified as an incomplete fix for the BatBadBut vulnerability. This vulnerability arises from improper handling of batch files with all possible extensions on Windows via `child_process.spawn` / `child_process.spawnSync`. A malicious command line argument can inject arbitrary commands and achieve code execution even if the shell option is not enabled.\n\nThis vulnerability affects all users of `child_process.spawn` and `child_process.spawnSync` on Windows in all active release lines.",
